			"notes": "## AxisRuler 1.2.0\n\n- Added NeoForge support for Minecraft `1.21.4`, `1.21.8`, `1.21.11`, and `26.1` to `26.1.2`\n- The config screen now opens from the in-game mod list on NeoForge (no Mod Menu required)\n- NeoForge builds are client-only and connection-safe, so you can join servers without the mod\n- No gameplay changes for existing Fabric users — same features and keybinds\n\nPick the jar matching your Minecraft version and loader (Fabric or NeoForge)."
